{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bounce, suffer, and try again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pogo-Stick: Ultimate Challenge \u2014 a brutally difficult physics-based platformer where one wrong bounce sends you back to the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control your pogo with only your mouse. Left click to compress the spring. Find the perfect angle. Jump. Miss. Fall. Climb again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no checkpoints. There is no mercy. Only your skill and pain tolerance.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the pogo-stick </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf32 Jump through forests, cliffs, and absurd obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 Expect to fall. A lot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 Reach the top... if you can</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3663980?t=1745428275","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3663980?t=1745428275","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/c86f1e822c10fef5356e908ce3064a2821c63a18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745428275","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/c86f1e822c10fef5356e908ce3064a2821c63a18/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745428275","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bounce, suffer, and try again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pogo-Stick: Ultimate Challenge \u2014 a brutally difficult physics-based platformer where one wrong bounce sends you back to the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control your pogo with only your mouse. Left click to compress the spring. Find the perfect ang